  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We_change is the largest high school initiative for sustainable development. Together with partners and motivators we discuss sustainability based on the 17 global sustainable development goals, and every year we_change meets about 6000 high school students for lectures, workshops and panel debates.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">We_change &#xe4;r Sveriges st&#xf6;rsta gymnasiesatsning f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbar utveckling. Tillsammans med samarbetspartners och inspirat&#xf6;rer diskuteras h&#xe5;llbarhet utifr&#xe5;n de 17 globala m&#xe5;len f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbar utveckling och varje &#xe5;r tr&#xe4;ffar we_change cirka 6000 gymnasieelever f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rel&#xe4;sningar, workshops och pandeldebatter.</narrative>
  </description>
